<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06r0301_middleman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンを　さがしもとめる　うちに
ひとは　くらす　ばしょを　ふやした▼
ぼくじょうも　もともとは
ただの　くさむら　だったが▼
いまでは　ポケモンと　ひとが
ともに　くらす　エリアに　なったよな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:17:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンを　探し求める　うちに
人々は　暮らす　場所を　増やした▼
牧場も　元々は
ただの　草むら　だったが▼
今では　ポケモンと　人が
共に　暮らす　エリアに　なったよな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:16:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:16:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:29:27" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06r0301_middlewoman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたし　ポケモンの　タイプとか
あんまり　くわしくないから▼
１ひきだけを　がんがん　そだてて
どんどん　さきに　すすんじゃうのよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:07:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたし　ポケモンの　タイプとか
あんまり　詳しくないから▼
１匹だけを　がんがん　育てて
どんどん　先に　進んじゃうのよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:08:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・連れているポケモンが３匹以下</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:04:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEWOMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:29:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06r0301_middlewoman2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あら？　たくさんの　ポケモン！▼
どのコを　どんなふうに　そだてるか
かんがえるのって　たのしそうねえ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:07:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あら？　たくさんの　ポケモン！▼
どのコを　どんな風に　育てるか
考えるのって　楽しそうねえ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:08:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・連れているポケモンが４匹以上</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:04:45" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEWOMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:29:36" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
